					597</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">1081</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ac silvestres cursus lustrationesque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 5, 27, 79</span></i>
